    "description": "Fuji Oozx Inc. engages in the manufacturing and sale of engine valves and other engine related components in Japan and internationally. The company offers engine valves, hollow valves, cotters/retainers, and valve seats, machinery, and rotators. It is also involved in the processing of steel material, and sales of processed products; and tools and jigs, as well as engaging in the sale, purchasing, repair, and lending of machine tools and equipment installment contracts. In addition, it engages in manufacturing and sales of precision parts for factory automation equipment, metal products and parts such as metal rolls and shafts used in the manufacture of separator films for lithium-ion batteries. The company was incorporated in 1951 and is headquartered in Kikugawa, Japan."
